WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.339
Watch and read: You sound out the written word “cat”. What is the best answer?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.829
The answer is: Join c plus a plus t to say cat. Read the instruction carefully and

00:00:10.829 --> 00:00:12.816
choose the helpful or correct response.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:17.307
Watch and read: Blend the sounds c - a - t. What word do they make?

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:21.871
The answer is: cat. Say the sounds in order and blend smoothly.
